This repository is an independent local implementation of the Camunda
"Intelligent Security Incident Processing" blueprint. The original blueprint,
its BPMN models and forms remain the property of their respective authors and
are distributed under their own terms:
https://marketplace.camunda.com/en-US/apps/830621/intelligent-security-incident-processing

The MIT license above applies to the modifications and additions made in this
repository: the local stub servers, the Kafka producer, the English
translations, the connector re-pointing and the documentation.
